### =====================================================================
### store-service - ready-to-run requests
###
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and the IntelliJ HTTP Client.
### Calls the service DIRECTLY on port 8103, so we send the X-User-* headers
### ourselves (normally the API gateway adds them from the JWT).
###
### Seed data (docs/seed-data.md):
###   store 1 Fresh Mart   (owner user 3 = vendor1)   ACTIVE
###   store 2 Green Basket (owner user 6 = vendor2)   ACTIVE
###   user 10 = vendor3 has NO store yet -> use it to register one (request 4)
###   user 2 = admin, user 1 = super admin
### =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8103


### 1. PUBLIC: list active stores in Bengaluru (no headers needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stores?city=Bengaluru


### 2. PUBLIC: which stores deliver to PIN code 560034?
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stores?pincode=560034


### 3. PUBLIC: one store, with opening hours and "openNow"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stores/1


### 4. VENDOR (user 10): register my store -> PENDING_APPROVAL, publishes StoreRegistered
#    (run once; a second run gives 409 "You already have a store")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/store
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 10
X-User-Role: VENDOR

{
  "name": "Daily Needs Supermarket",
  "description": "Groceries, dairy and household items",
  "phone": "9000000010",
  "email": "dailyneeds@example.com",
  "addressLine1": "22, 5th Cross, Malleshwaram",
  "city": "Bengaluru",
  "state": "Karnataka",
  "pincode": "560003",
  "latitude": 13.003100,
  "longitude": 77.571400
}


### 5. VENDOR (user 10): my store
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/store
X-User-Id: 10
X-User-Role: VENDOR


### 6. VENDOR (user 10): weekly opening hours ("closed" is optional; missing days are closed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/store/opening-hours
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 10
X-User-Role: VENDOR

{
  "days": [
    { "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY",    "opensAt": "08:00", "closesAt": "21:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "TUESDAY",   "opensAt": "08:00", "closesAt": "21:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "WEDNESDAY", "opensAt": "08:00", "closesAt": "21:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "THURSDAY",  "opensAt": "08:00", "closesAt": "21:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "FRIDAY",    "opensAt": "08:00", "closesAt": "21:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "SATURDAY",  "opensAt": "09:00", "closesAt": "22:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "SUNDAY",    "closed": true }
  ]
}


### 7. VENDOR (user 10): PIN codes my store delivers to
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/store/delivery-areas
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 10
X-User-Role: VENDOR

{
  "pincodes": ["560003", "560020", "560055"]
}


### 8. VENDOR: invalid store details -> 400 with one error per field
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/store
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 99
X-User-Role: VENDOR

{
  "name": "",
  "phone": "12345",
  "addressLine1": "x",
  "city": "Bengaluru",
  "state": "Karnataka",
  "pincode": "012345"
}


### 9. ADMIN: the approval queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/stores?status=PENDING_APPROVAL
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Role: ADMIN


### 10. ADMIN: approve store 3 (the one from request 4) -> ACTIVE, publishes StoreApproved
#     auth-service consumes it and vendor3's next login token contains storeId 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/stores/3/approve
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Role: ADMIN


### 11. ADMIN: approving it again -> 400 (only PENDING_APPROVAL stores can be approved)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/stores/3/approve
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Role: ADMIN


### 12. VENDOR (user 3): pause new orders at Fresh Mart (send true to resume)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/store/accepting-orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 3
X-User-Role: VENDOR

{
  "acceptingOrders": false
}


### 13. ADMIN: disable Green Basket -> publishes StoreStatusChanged
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/stores/2/disable
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{
  "reason": "Temporarily closed for renovation"
}


### 14. ADMIN: enable Green Basket again
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/stores/2/enable
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Role: ADMIN


### 15. SUPER_ADMIN: set Fresh Mart's commission to 12.5 %
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/stores/1/commission
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN

{
  "commissionPercentage": 12.50
}


### 16. INTERNAL (service-to-service): any store in any status
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/stores/1


### 17. Unknown store -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stores/9999
